[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MainMenu/AspectRatioContainer3" unique_id=769024645]
layout_mode = 2
text = "

Hey everyone, my name is Silvester.
During my coffee breaks I help my coworker Johnny get the things he needs.

Watch the labels carefully and bring him the correct items.

But be careful — fruits keep falling from the tree.
Catch them before they hit the ground or you won't get any juice...

And if Johnny doesn't get what he needs...
something terrible might happen."

